OL,3,GNEWSABentley unveils its first fully
OL,4,Aelectric car
OL,5,
OL,6,FBentley has unveiled its first fully
OL,7,Felectric car after investing #350m to
OL,8,Fupgrade its factory in Cheshire.
OL,10,FThe Torcal SUV will be built on a
OL,11,Fbrand-new production line at the site,
OL,12,Fwhich has been the luxury carmaker's
OL,13,Fheadquarters since 1946.
OL,15,FBusiness secretary Jonathan Reynolds
OL,16,Fsaid the investment would "support
OL,17,F4,000 high-value local jobs in Crewe".
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
